<!-- @opening -->
<p class="story-lead">The socket reconnects successfully, but the server no longer retains the events behind the saved cursor. Connectivity is restored; continuity is still an application decision.</p>

<!-- @before Reconnection: The Hard Part :: animation -->
### A new connection does not fill a history gap

<section class="pb-figure" data-pb-flow="scene" aria-label="Reset the cursor without losing a pending edit">
<h3>Walkthrough 1. Reset the cursor without losing a pending edit</h3><p class="pb-sub">Illustrative application reset protocol. SSE and WebSocket do not define this snapshot/outbox policy for the app.</p>
